<title>GERMANY: Schering details sales by group.</title>
<headline>Schering details sales by group.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30 (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>     Group sales				  3,846  vs 3,449</p>
<p>     Diagnostics				 1,203   vs 1,194</p>
<p>     Fertility control and hormone	 1,171   vs 1,056</p>
<p>	   therapy</p>
<p>	 Therapeutics			    1,003   vs 870</p>
<p>	 Dermatology			     305     vs 299</p>
<p>	 Other				     164     vs 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German pharmaceutical group is Schering AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
